        summary {Get a list of dsp cells in the current design.}
        synopsis {all_dsps ?-quiet? ?-verbose?}
        description {Returns a list of all DSP cell objects that have been declared in the current design.}
        returns {List of dsp cell objects.}
        example {set_false_path -from [all_dsps] -to [all_registers]}
