        description {Defines a new ChipScope debug core to be added to an open Netlist Design in the current project, with ports for connecting nets for debug purposes. The default core includes a CLK port and a trigger (TRIG) port, and because the CLK port supports only one clock signal a separate core is needed per clock domain; ports are added with create_debug_port and signals connected with connect_debug_port.}
