        summary {Create a new wave configuration and open a wave window for it.}
        synopsis {create_wave_config ?-quiet? ?-verbose? ?name?}
        description {Creates a new wave configuration of the specified name, or of a default name when no name is given. A new wave window showing that WCFG is also created and made the current wave window.}
        returns {Nothing.}
