        synopsis {current_run ?-synthesis? ?-implementation? ?-quiet? ?-verbose? ?run?}
        description {Defines the current synthesis or implementation run, or returns the name of the current run. The current run is the one automatically selected when the Synthesize or Implement commands are launched. Use get_runs to determine the list of runs defined in the current design.}
