        summary {Delete ChipScope debug ports.}
        synopsis {delete_debug_port ?-quiet? ?-verbose? ports...}
        description {Deletes ports from ChipScope debug cores in the current project, each named as core_name/port_name. A signal can instead be disconnected from a port with disconnect_debug_port. Some ports cannot be deleted, because an ILA port requires at least one CLK port and one TRIG port.}
