        description {Returns the pins on the specified BELs, or those matching a search pattern; the default pattern is the wildcard * which gets all BEL pins on the device. Multiple search patterns must be enclosed in braces to present the list as a single element. Like every get_ command it returns a container list of a single type of object, and only objects of that type may be appended to it.}
        returns {A list of bel_pindef objects.}
        example {get_bel_pins *CE}
        source {Xilinx UG835 2012.2}
    }
}
