        description {Gets a list of I/O Banks on the target device in the current project that match a specified search pattern; the default is to get all I/O Banks on the target device. The get_* commands return a container list holding a single type of object, so only objects of that same type may be appended to the result.}
        returns {Iobanks.}
        example {get_iobanks -of_objects [get_package_pins H4]}
        source {Xilinx UG835 2012.2}
    }
}
