        synopsis {list_property ?-class class? ?object? ?-quiet? ?-verbose?}
        description {Gets a list of all properties on a specified object or class. When both -class and object are specified, the properties of the specific object are returned, and specifying multiple objects is an error. Note report_property also returns a list of properties on an object, but includes the property type and property value.}
