        synopsis {open_saif file_name ?-quiet? ?-verbose?}
        description {Opens the named file for storing the signal switching rate used for power estimation. The switching rate is written out in Synopsys Activity Interchange Format, commonly known as SAIF.}
        returns {The SAIF object that was opened.}
