        synopsis {place_cell cell_site_list ... ?-quiet? ?-verbose?}
        description {Places cells onto device resources of the target part, taking a list of cells and sites in the interleaved order cell_name site, repeated as needed. Cells can be placed onto specific BEL sites or into available SLICE resources, in which case the tool determines an appropriate BEL within the SLICE if one is available; the site must not be currently occupied or an error is returned. The same syntax places an unplaced cell or moves a placed cell, and the command operates silently without returning direct feedback of its operation.}
