        summary {Import package pin and port placement information.}
        synopsis {read_csv ?-quiet_diff_pairs? file ?-quiet? ?-verbose?}
        description {Imports port definition and package pin placement information from a comma separated value (CSV) file. In an I/O Pin Planning project, importing a CSV file replaces the current port definitions and any ports not found in the imported file are removed; in all other projects the port definitions come from the source design data, while package pin assignments and port attributes can be read from the CSV file. Ports read from the CSV file cannot have spaces in the name.}
        returns {Nothing.}
        example {read_csv C/Data/pinList.csv}
        source {Xilinx UG835 2012.2}
    }
}
