        description {Reads a Value Change Dump (VCD) file for use during power analysis by the report_power command, annotating the design nodes with activity from the file so that running report_power afterwards uses its activity rates. Switching activity can also be read in the form of an SAIF file using the read_saif command.}
        returns {Nothing.}
        example {read_vcd C:/Data/design1.vcd}
        source {Xilinx UG835 2012.2}
    }
}
