        description {Runs the Vivado integrated simulator for the given length of simulation time, where time is all or any decimal number and may be followed, with or without an intervening space, by one of the time units fs, ps, ns, us, ms, or sec. Without a unit the value of the time_unit property is used.}
        returns {Nothing.}
        source {Xilinx UG835 2012.2}
    }
}
