        summary {Set the speed grade used for timing analysis.}
        synopsis {set_speed_grade value ?-quiet? ?-verbose?}
        description {Sets the speed grade for the target device in the current design, for the purpose of timing analysis. It must be run on an opened Synthesized or Implemented Design, usually prior to report_timing or other timing commands. Valid values are -1, -2, or -3.}
        returns {String result.}
