        description {Moves the group of cells inside a hierarchy cell to its parent cell, and then removes the hierarchical cell. The connections between these cells are maintained, and the connections between these cells and other cells are maintained through the crossing hierarchy cell. The cells argument matches engine names against cell names and defaults to all cells.}
